<title>UK: Rugby names Crowley CEO of Australian unit.</title>
<headline>Rugby names Crowley CEO of Australian unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British building materials company Rugby Group Plc said on Wednesday it had named Peter Crowley chief executive designate of its Australian unit Cockburn Cement Ltd.</p>
<p>Rugby Group said Crowley, previously a general manager at Queensland Cement, would succeed Don McDonald in the early part of next year.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
